{
	chapter.3164986BA5C4E895.title: "A new enchanting system"
	quest.25F112402554FEC7.quest_desc: [
		"&bMatrix Enchanting&r is a complete overhaul of the enchanting system. &9Pieces can be generated using lapis and XP&r. The pieces then have to be laid on the grid to enchant the item. Pieces can be rotated and upgraded into higher levels."
		""
		"- You can press the + button to generate new pieces. Each piece will contain an enchantment."
		"- The pieces you generate will land in the docket, the rightmost side bar."
		"- You can pick pieces from the docket and put them in the grid. Pieces put in the grid will affect the output enchantment."
		"- You can rotate pieces by right clicking."
		"- Generated pieces always come at enchantment level 1. To upgrade a piece you placed down in the grid, simply grab one with the same enchantment and click it on top of the placed one."
	]
	quest.36BFBE0F6B8ACC85.quest_desc: [
