	quest.36BFBE0F6B8ACC85.quest_subtitle: "Candles can be used to manipulate what type of enchantments you'd like to get"
	quest.66A62A40AC810EA7.quest_desc: ["Lapis can be placed in the the bottom-left slot. The lapis is stored as a \"charge\" meter, which you can see in the left blue bar."]
